      "content": "wait, you said dextromethorphan is natural? i thought it was a drug. and i'm a bit confused about the dosage part... you said take 30mg of dextromethorphan and then follow it up with a dose of the cough syrup? doesn't the syrup already have the dextromethorphan in it? i don't want to accidentally take too much or cause an interaction, especially with my sertraline.",
